 and coke line have been revised in conjunction with the new sidepod inlet enhancing the flow conditioning downstream.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Coke/Engine Cover","reason":"Performance - Flow Conditioning","type":"Performance","geometry":"Alternative Sidepod Shape","description":"An alternative sidepod shape is available as an option for the aforementioned bodywork, resulting in a change of resultant aerodynamic properties.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Cooling Louvres","reason":"Circuit specific - Cooling Range","type":"Circuit specific","geometry":"New Louvre Layout","description":"As part of the new bodywork package, cooling louvre layout and position have been altered for maximum aerodynamic performance at various cooling levels.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Floor Edge","reason":"Performance – Local Load","type":"Performance","geometry":"Revised Floor Edge Shape","description":"The flow conditioning changes from the bodywork are utilised by a revised floor edge design, resulting in improved aerodynamic performance.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Diffuser","reason":"Performance – Local Load","type":"Performance","geometry":"Revised Diffuser Layout","description":"In conjunction with the floor edge, the diffuser has been revised, aiming at extracting more aerodynamic performance from the new flow topology.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Rear Suspension","reason":"Performance - Flow Conditioning","type":"Performance","geo