 of cooling levels offered previously.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Mirrors","reason":"Flow Conditioning","type":"Performance","geometry":"Revised mirror geometry","description":"Also accompanying the floor and sidepod, the mirror assembly geometry has been revised to aid the downstream conditioning and supplement the","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Halo","reason":"Flow Conditioning","type":"Performance","geometry":"Revised halo fairing geometry","description":"local load increase. A small change to revise a turning vane on the fairing to better serve downstream components, the flow stability and therefore load generation.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"}]},{"team":"Ferrari","updates":[]},{"team":"Williams","updates":[{"component":"Floor","reason":"Performance - Local Load","type":"Performance","geometry":"An updated Floor Bodywork Assembly has been introduced, including new Floor Leading Edge devices, Floor Body and Floor Corner geometry.","description":"We have modified the forward and outboard regions of the floor to extract more performance both locally and across the main underfloor","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Tail","reason":"Performance - Local Load","type":"Performance","geometry":"A revised Tail geometry has been introduced to suit the new Floor update.","description":"surfaces. The new surfaces work together with the new floor to generate increased performance locally around the RIS.","source":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_azerbaijan_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf"},{"component":"Front Corner","reaso